## Part 1 - The current CHM import process (Existing)

The CHM import is a SQL Agent job that runs one SSIS package every 30 minutes. The package stages a fixed-width mainframe file, and a chain of LASOutsourcing stored procedures turns each row into an open item that processors work on the TDT COP screens. In Dev the job is currently disabled and the package last ran on 2026-06-12.

